WEBVTT

00:01.150 --> 00:03.480
I'm looking for a certain adventurer.

00:03.900 --> 00:08.570
That adventurer can defeat
many magic beasts on his own.

00:08.570 --> 00:11.200
Do you know about him?

00:11.200 --> 00:14.080
I never heard of someone
like that before.

00:14.790 --> 00:16.230
Excuse me.

00:20.960 --> 00:24.500
Where are you, Sir Flio?

00:27.300 --> 00:29.760
It looks delicious!

00:29.760 --> 00:31.590
Bon appétit!

00:32.220 --> 00:33.930
So delicious!

00:34.390 --> 00:36.640
The soup is perfect.

00:36.640 --> 00:38.100
I'm glad.

00:38.580 --> 00:40.850
Hiya helped me to cook.

00:41.940 --> 00:47.240
I can make them with my magic,
but Mistress does not want that.

00:47.630 --> 00:52.240
It's my duty to make food
for my dear and his pack.

00:52.240 --> 00:56.240
If you want, can you help us
with the cleaning and laundry?

00:56.240 --> 00:57.580
I understand.

00:58.000 --> 01:01.080
Then I will clean this house
in an instant.

01:01.080 --> 01:02.460
W-What to do now?

01:02.460 --> 01:06.710
Although cooking was
originally Lady Rys' duty.

01:06.710 --> 01:12.470
So we help with other chores
to keep up the appearance.

01:12.470 --> 01:15.310
But if that role is taken away from us...

01:15.310 --> 01:16.970
...we are all total bumps.

01:17.390 --> 01:19.640
Please try this one, Exalted One.

01:20.290 --> 01:21.810
Thank you.

01:21.810 --> 01:26.610
By the way, about this "Exalted One,"
could you cut it out?

01:26.610 --> 01:28.110
It's embarrassing.

01:28.440 --> 01:29.990
What are you saying?

01:29.990 --> 01:32.700
You are the Exalted One
because that is who you are.

01:34.440 --> 01:35.530
What's wrong, everyone?

01:35.950 --> 01:37.170
You're not going to eat?

01:52.680 --> 02:04.440
CHILLIN' IN ANOTHER WORLD
WITH LV2 SUPER CHEAT POWERS

03:09.960 --> 03:14.420
#7: TO EACH OF OUR FUTURES

03:14.420 --> 03:19.890
I won't lose to that djinn
when it's about working on fields.

03:32.690 --> 03:39.030
I was hoping to help the house
by working as a coachman,

03:39.030 --> 03:43.490
but the best I can do
is to raise the horses.

03:46.460 --> 03:47.920
Hey!

03:49.790 --> 03:53.250
Please only lick my cheeks!

03:58.650 --> 04:03.010
Father, brother, the thing is...

04:03.560 --> 04:09.560
I left the Knights before I could
become a royal mage like you two.

04:10.350 --> 04:14.530
So I feel there's no need for me
to get any stronger anymore, but...

04:17.670 --> 04:20.620
Then, try to do what I just taught you.

04:22.420 --> 04:23.810
Fire Lance.

04:28.470 --> 04:30.960
You did it, Belano!

04:34.550 --> 04:41.840
I don't want to let the effort that Sir Flio
put into teaching me to waste.

04:41.840 --> 04:45.010
I want to be able to use more spells.

04:45.010 --> 04:46.770
S-Stop!

04:48.770 --> 04:51.350
Hey, stop it!

04:53.560 --> 04:56.750
No! My fields!

04:57.780 --> 04:58.440
A horse?

04:58.440 --> 04:59.990
A magic beast?!

05:01.910 --> 05:02.870
It's dangerous!

05:09.250 --> 05:11.420
Are you hurt?

05:11.420 --> 05:13.000
I'm okay.

05:13.000 --> 05:14.340
I'm sorry.

05:14.340 --> 05:17.130
Even though it's a magic beast,
it seemed too docile,

05:17.130 --> 05:20.220
so I brought it here
because I couldn't bear to kill it.

05:20.220 --> 05:22.300
But now that it's attacked people...

05:23.440 --> 05:27.640
Wait! Did it suddenly go wild?

05:27.640 --> 05:29.310
Yeah.

05:31.440 --> 05:33.100
Stop it!

05:34.560 --> 05:35.770
I think I know the cause.

05:35.770 --> 05:38.900
Sybe! Turn into a rabbit!

05:52.750 --> 05:54.210
Steady!

05:54.210 --> 05:57.170
Steady, steady...

05:57.170 --> 05:59.440
Way to go, Byleri!

06:00.210 --> 06:02.300
You can even handle a magic beast.

06:02.680 --> 06:05.600
You're still so good with horses.

06:05.600 --> 06:06.970
It's nothing.

06:13.600 --> 06:19.230
Balirossa, is it possible to use
this large area of land around here?

06:19.230 --> 06:22.650
This area is the land of
the lord of the town.

06:22.650 --> 06:27.120
I think you could use it
if you buy it like Sir Flio.

06:27.740 --> 06:30.080
I see. Then...

06:32.250 --> 06:35.250
We finally have some time
alone together, my dear.

06:35.540 --> 06:37.890
I'm happy since it seems like
we're going on a date.

06:37.890 --> 06:41.380
Well, it's not really a date since
we're only here to sell some armor.

06:41.380 --> 06:43.470
I don't mind it.

06:43.470 --> 06:48.970
Now that we're a real married couple,
we can flirt as much as we want.

06:48.970 --> 06:52.140
We're always getting interrupted at home.

06:52.140 --> 06:53.180
Yeah.

06:53.180 --> 06:56.940
But I'm happy just to be with you.

07:00.050 --> 07:03.150
I'm happy, too!

07:04.190 --> 07:07.780
Oh? Is it made of salamander skin?

07:07.780 --> 07:09.830
This is a good piece.

07:09.830 --> 07:12.450
Thank you.

07:12.450 --> 07:15.620
It's lightweight, so it might be
suitable for a woman.

07:15.620 --> 07:18.500
If so, it could use a little ornamentation.

07:18.940 --> 07:20.840
Would you like to put a magic gem on it?

07:20.840 --> 07:21.590
Sure.

07:23.380 --> 07:25.300
This one is beautiful.

07:25.300 --> 07:28.180
That magic gem is called a gemstone.

07:28.180 --> 07:31.010
So rare it's ridiculously expensive.

07:31.390 --> 07:32.600
I see.

07:34.730 --> 07:38.310
His working face is so cool.

07:38.310 --> 07:40.690
My dear!

07:48.740 --> 07:50.030
How is it?

07:50.030 --> 07:51.620
We couldn't find anything.

07:51.620 --> 07:53.160
Is that so?

07:55.790 --> 07:57.120
What's that?

08:00.460 --> 08:03.300
What's that monster?!

08:05.300 --> 08:06.420
Rys!

08:06.420 --> 08:11.050
My dear! That monster suddenly
appeared from the sky.

08:11.530 --> 08:13.720
The people in town are in danger.
Let's go!

08:13.720 --> 08:14.520
Yes!

08:17.940 --> 08:18.940
The town...

08:18.940 --> 08:20.940
I found you.

08:21.400 --> 08:23.610
Don't let it get near the Princess!

08:23.610 --> 08:26.070
Don't get in my way, small fries.

08:31.200 --> 08:32.200
Hiya!

08:32.200 --> 08:34.030
Why are you here?

08:34.030 --> 08:39.790
I sensed a surge of evil,
so I hurried here from home.

08:39.790 --> 08:42.670
That monster is a human.

08:43.080 --> 08:46.380
And that witch was the one
who turned him through magic.

08:46.700 --> 08:47.340
Witch?

08:47.800 --> 08:48.670
Yes.

08:48.670 --> 08:52.550
She is the Grand Magus of Midnight,
Damalynas the Apricot.

08:53.180 --> 08:57.430
She once ruled over the Magical Kingdom
of Klyrode as the strongest mage.

08:57.430 --> 09:02.270
A woman who touched forbidden magic,
the black magic.

09:02.270 --> 09:05.900
She was defeated by
the hero of that time,

09:05.900 --> 09:09.030
but even after her body was destroyed,
her will lingered on.

09:09.030 --> 09:13.740
She was sealed in the pedestal of
the sword where I was sealed.

09:13.740 --> 09:18.950
It seems she was revived
when I was released from my seal.

09:18.950 --> 09:21.870
Do you mean this is all your fault?

09:22.290 --> 09:23.330
That is right.

09:23.330 --> 09:30.340
They needed me as the sword to seal her
since humans were too weak.

09:30.340 --> 09:35.600
I suppose it is indeed my fault,
after the fool who released me.

09:35.600 --> 09:38.600
This is not the time for sarcasm.

09:38.600 --> 09:40.310
Exalted One.

09:40.850 --> 09:44.940
I would like to go and eliminate this
infidel who is destroying this town.

09:44.940 --> 09:47.400
Would you grant me the permission?

09:47.810 --> 09:49.190
I allow it.

09:49.190 --> 09:52.110
But prioritize the lives of
the people in the town.

09:52.740 --> 09:54.200
As you wish.

09:54.560 --> 09:56.780
We're going to rescue and evacuate them.

09:57.140 --> 09:57.990
Yes!

09:58.910 --> 10:01.960
Now what are you going
to do now, Princess?

10:01.960 --> 10:06.000
You're down to one tinpot
to protect you.

10:06.000 --> 10:08.670
This is a desperate situation,
don't you think so?

10:08.670 --> 10:13.510
So you're back, Damalynas
the Grand Magus of Midnight!

10:14.510 --> 10:16.470
That's a nice face you're making.

10:16.470 --> 10:20.270
I want to keep looking at it,
but too bad.

10:20.270 --> 10:22.230
I will take your life now!

10:29.190 --> 10:31.320
The Djinn of Light and Dark, Hiya!

10:31.610 --> 10:35.280
Why are you interrupting my fun?!

10:35.280 --> 10:37.660
Your fun is no concern of mine.

10:37.660 --> 10:42.620
I am here to dispose of those
who disturb the Exalted One.

10:42.620 --> 10:46.380
How dare you talk big!
A djinn who failed to grant wishes!

10:52.380 --> 10:54.760
You stopped my spell
with a single arm?

10:54.760 --> 10:58.970
There is no spell in this world
that can harm me.

10:59.330 --> 11:04.560
A resident of this world like you
will never come close to me.

11:04.560 --> 11:05.940
Is that so?

11:06.270 --> 11:08.900
Then how about this?!

11:10.230 --> 11:14.060
Resorting to brute force since your
spells did not work? How foolish.

11:14.060 --> 11:15.200
Of course not!

11:15.570 --> 11:18.950
Black Magic, Fire Lance Noire!

11:23.750 --> 11:28.420
Even magic combined with
a direct attack won't do?

11:28.420 --> 11:30.040
This is so annoying!

11:30.040 --> 11:36.260
There's no way I can lose
even if my opponent is a djinn!

11:38.640 --> 11:41.100
O' abyss that lies
in the depths of the earth,

11:41.100 --> 11:43.520
it's time to unleash
your merciless darkness.

11:43.520 --> 11:45.730
Open the gate
and dye this world in black!

11:52.480 --> 11:54.190
Oh, no...

11:54.190 --> 11:56.990
If a monster that size rampages,
this town will...

12:13.690 --> 12:14.770
This is...

12:15.590 --> 12:17.510
The Exalted One.

12:17.930 --> 12:22.510
I dispelled that one since that huge
thing looked dangerous. Did it work?

12:22.510 --> 12:24.600
Please forgive me.

12:25.020 --> 12:29.770
I never meant to trouble you.
Please punish me as you see fit.

12:29.770 --> 12:31.940
Cut it out.

12:32.320 --> 12:36.570
At the very least,
allow me to finish this.

12:41.160 --> 12:45.830
Impossible! There's no way a human
could do that to my spell!

12:46.330 --> 12:47.410
Perish.

13:02.800 --> 13:08.430
Be honored, you shall exist
eternally as part of me.

13:11.770 --> 13:14.310
Will you be okay after eating that?

13:14.310 --> 13:15.400
Yes.

13:15.400 --> 13:21.490
I have freed this woman from her possession
and sealed her within my psychic realm.

13:21.950 --> 13:29.530
I will properly discipline her so that
her power can be used for your sake.

13:30.130 --> 13:32.540
You understand it well.

13:32.540 --> 13:35.210
You honor me, Mistress.

13:37.130 --> 13:40.590
Anyway, he's really a troublesome hero.

13:40.590 --> 13:44.850
Since they're unconscious,
let's just leave them to the Knights.

13:45.710 --> 13:47.560
You're Sir Flio, right?

13:48.310 --> 13:49.810
Yes, I am.

13:49.810 --> 13:51.390
We finally meet.

13:52.190 --> 13:53.840
Pleased to meet you, Sir Flio.

13:54.470 --> 13:59.610
I am the First Princess of the Magical
Kingdom of Klyrode, Elizabeth Klyrode.

14:01.200 --> 14:05.950
Thank you for saving our kingdom from crisis.

14:06.550 --> 14:09.750
Allow me to apologize on behalf of the King

14:09.750 --> 14:13.920
as well as the former hero
for their behavior.

14:13.920 --> 14:17.670
Oh, no. Please raise your head.

14:17.670 --> 14:19.420
Wait, former hero?

14:19.850 --> 14:20.630
Yes.

14:20.630 --> 14:25.680
The other day, I dismissed him due to
his repeated problematic behavior.

14:26.660 --> 14:31.060
In fact, we came to this town
to search for you.

14:31.680 --> 14:35.690
Will you please come to the castle
as the true hero?

14:37.310 --> 14:40.650
Now that the hope of
the people is gone,

14:41.070 --> 14:45.450
it must be God's guidance
that we met you here.

14:45.450 --> 14:46.740
Please.

14:46.740 --> 14:48.620
I'm sorry.

14:49.160 --> 14:55.750
Such a big role should be given to someone
who won't hesitate to fight for humans.

14:55.750 --> 14:58.160
And I cannot do that.

14:59.100 --> 15:02.840
Besides, my current lifestyle
suits me much better.

15:03.630 --> 15:07.720
My wish is to have a peaceful life
with my wife.

15:07.720 --> 15:09.260
That's enough for me.

15:09.680 --> 15:11.410
My dear...

15:13.310 --> 15:14.560
We're home!

15:14.560 --> 15:16.350
Welcome back!

15:16.350 --> 15:20.020
We were waiting for you because
we have something to discuss.

15:20.020 --> 15:21.320
What is it?

15:21.320 --> 15:24.150
It's only if you allow it,

15:24.580 --> 15:27.110
I want you to expand our land.

15:27.110 --> 15:28.160
Expand it?

15:28.160 --> 15:32.120
I'd like to catch and breed
horse species magic beasts.

15:32.120 --> 15:35.660
To do so, we need to have
a large area of land.

15:35.660 --> 15:41.250
If we can increase the area of the fields,
we can grow more vegetables.

15:41.250 --> 15:45.590
The vegetables we harvest will be
transported by the magic beast carrier.

15:45.590 --> 15:47.970
So we won't have to trouble you.

15:47.970 --> 15:52.600
Aside from someone as powerful as him,

15:52.600 --> 15:57.270
it's hard to imagine that a magic beast
would follow a weak human race.

15:57.270 --> 15:59.440
Wouldn't it be better
to use normal horses?

15:59.830 --> 16:02.480
Because normal horses aren't cheap.

16:02.480 --> 16:06.580
I think, if we raise the magic beast
in a spacious place,

16:06.580 --> 16:09.780
it will grow up docile.

16:10.170 --> 16:13.240
Sure, I will try to negotiate
with the lord.

16:13.670 --> 16:15.620
Thank you so much!

16:15.620 --> 16:19.370
But could you let us handle
the money and negotiations?

16:19.370 --> 16:20.210
Yes, right.

16:20.210 --> 16:23.420
Huh? I'm fine with it,
but are you sure?

16:23.420 --> 16:27.470
I mean, when I bought this land
for our house...

16:27.470 --> 16:29.180
The price was around this much.

16:30.640 --> 16:34.010
Even though it's far away from the capital,
it still costs that much?!

16:34.010 --> 16:36.930
Since the land is so big,
I think this is the right price.

16:36.930 --> 16:41.480
There's no demon around this area,
so the price of the land has gone up.

16:41.900 --> 16:45.480
The savings from when I was a member
of the Knights won't be enough.

16:45.480 --> 16:48.240
I think we can manage
if we sell our weapons.

16:48.240 --> 16:51.490
No need to worry.
I'll pay for it.

16:51.990 --> 16:54.240
Since it'll be part of this house,

16:54.240 --> 16:57.290
you can pay it back by managing
all that land for me.

16:57.290 --> 16:59.460
But that is too much...

16:59.460 --> 17:00.910
You don't agree?

17:02.620 --> 17:04.170
Then, thirty percent.

17:04.170 --> 17:09.720
I want you to pay thirty percent of
the money you get from that land to me.

17:10.150 --> 17:11.510
How's that?

17:13.430 --> 17:14.680
If it's settled...

17:15.640 --> 17:17.140
Let's plow the land!

17:17.140 --> 17:20.520
Plow the land!

17:20.520 --> 17:21.650
My, my...

17:21.650 --> 17:25.440
She looks happier than during
the combat training.

17:25.440 --> 17:26.780
You're right.

17:28.360 --> 17:32.740
If you're thinking about
selling vegetables,

17:32.740 --> 17:36.870
how about growing something
that is hard to grow in this area?

17:37.330 --> 17:38.950
Something that's hard to grow?

17:38.950 --> 17:39.870
Yeah.

17:39.870 --> 17:43.750
With my magic,
I can control the climate here.

17:43.750 --> 17:47.050
We can adjust the conditions
depending on the crops.

17:47.050 --> 17:52.010
Please don't! That will make me
rely on your magic.

17:52.470 --> 17:55.760
I'm doing this because
I don't want to be a freeloader.

17:55.760 --> 17:58.140
Leave the fields to me.

17:58.140 --> 18:00.850
What about me, then?

18:01.390 --> 18:06.060
As the Exalted One's servant,
surely my magic will suffice.

18:06.480 --> 18:11.280
Vegetables are only delicious when they're
carefully nurtured under the sun.

18:11.740 --> 18:15.240
It's not a matter of resorting
to magic for everything.

18:15.660 --> 18:21.790
However, farming is inefficient
and subject to climate change.

18:21.790 --> 18:24.210
If we use magic...

18:24.210 --> 18:26.170
I don't want to, and it's final!

18:26.170 --> 18:28.050
But I'd like to see it.

18:28.050 --> 18:29.090
Belano?

18:29.090 --> 18:31.920
I'm curious about how Hiya uses magic.

18:33.380 --> 18:35.840
What's with this outfit?

18:35.840 --> 18:39.560
I've decided to go
to the Houghtow College of Magic.

18:39.560 --> 18:41.100
I'm going to take courses.

18:41.500 --> 18:43.690
You're going to study magic again?

18:44.030 --> 18:46.770
That's what I had in mind
when I submitted my application.

18:46.770 --> 18:51.530
But they said they could hire me
as a teacher, not a student.

18:51.530 --> 18:53.400
Belano is a teacher?

18:53.400 --> 18:55.070
That's great!

18:55.070 --> 18:59.370
Thanks to Sir Flio for teaching me spells

18:59.370 --> 19:02.000
that even I who have
a small magic power can use.

19:02.000 --> 19:06.000
It was you who made
the effort to master it.

19:06.000 --> 19:07.880
Congratulations on your new job.

19:08.300 --> 19:09.670
Thank you.

19:09.670 --> 19:13.630
I've been looking through
a lot of books on magic,

19:13.630 --> 19:15.220
and I've learned...

19:15.590 --> 19:23.180
Magic can be useful for everyday life,
not just for fighting.

19:23.810 --> 19:26.140
Blossom, please?

19:27.600 --> 19:32.430
How about using magic to grow
one on a section of the field?

19:33.090 --> 19:38.120
Whether the grown crops aren't as good as
the naturally-grown ones, it's your call to make.

19:38.510 --> 19:42.080
You don't have to sell it
if you're not satisfied with it.

19:44.250 --> 19:47.040
I can't refuse if you insist this much.

19:47.330 --> 19:50.590
Even if it's just a section,
it's still an important part of the field.

19:50.590 --> 19:53.590
I won't forgive you if you treat it badly.

19:53.590 --> 19:55.720
Understood.

20:07.690 --> 20:11.480
Everyone's amazing. They've found
exactly what they want to do.

20:11.480 --> 20:17.030
Yes, it makes me happy to see
everyone enjoying themselves.

20:17.030 --> 20:21.240
I found something I want to do, too.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.240
Huh?

20:22.710 --> 20:24.330
What is it?

20:24.330 --> 20:28.540
I'd like to open my own store
in this world someday.

20:28.540 --> 20:33.460
I'm sure your store will
be very prosperous!

20:33.880 --> 20:34.920
Is that so?

20:34.920 --> 20:36.630
Of course!

20:36.630 --> 20:40.260
I'll call on all my acquaintances
and have them visit the store.

20:40.260 --> 20:43.930
But your acquaintances are demons, right?

20:43.930 --> 20:47.640
I don't mind it, but it'll cause panic
in the town, won't it?

20:47.640 --> 20:51.020
I'll tell them to disguise
themselves as humans.

20:51.020 --> 20:53.520
So there's no need to worry.

20:56.070 --> 20:57.490
My dear.

20:57.490 --> 21:02.160
I will do anything for you.

21:02.160 --> 21:05.950
So please don't hesitate
to ask me anything you want.

21:06.370 --> 21:08.120
Thank you, Rys.

21:08.870 --> 21:11.230
Also, this is for you.

21:13.500 --> 21:18.220
I found a very beautiful gem,
so I made a ring.

21:18.760 --> 21:21.340
Would you like to receive it?

21:21.340 --> 21:23.300
Could this be...

21:23.890 --> 21:25.680
A wedding ring.

21:25.680 --> 21:27.310
Look, I have it too.

21:37.940 --> 21:42.280
My dear, I am...

21:42.280 --> 21:45.200
I am very happy right now!

21:49.290 --> 21:52.170
Why? Why?

21:52.170 --> 21:54.210
Why am I in this situation?

21:54.210 --> 21:56.380
Sir Hero!

21:56.380 --> 21:59.970
At this rate,
we're going to be executed.

22:00.720 --> 22:02.760
I'm not going to die
in a place like this!

22:02.760 --> 22:05.100
Hey, get me out of here now!

22:05.100 --> 22:09.980
Don't think you can get away
from doing this to me!

23:40.980 --> 23:42.360
Hey, Hiya, raise the temperature.

23:42.360 --> 23:43.320
Understood.

23:43.320 --> 23:44.820
Hey, Hiya, turn up the light.

23:44.820 --> 23:45.820
Understood.

23:45.820 --> 23:47.780
Hey, Hiya, play some music.

23:47.780 --> 23:48.660
Understood.

